{"3636930":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Professional Ship Simulator","steam_appid":3636930,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/64a3da97120e7cdb00f56190c6918533.poster.avif?t=1789576142\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/64a3da97120e7cdb00f56190c6918533.webm?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/64a3da97120e7cdb00f56190c6918533.mp4?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take full command in this deeply immersive, large-scale maritime simulation designed for players who value precision and authenticity. Each vessel is operated through detailed, true-to-life systems inspired by real ship operations, without relying on oversimplified mechanics or arcade shortcuts. From managing propulsion and navigation to responding to environmental forces, your success depends on skill, awareness, and control. Built with simulation enthusiasts in mind, this experience offers a focused and rewarding approach to mastering life at sea.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/5f4014ccb08b8f1f955c6d667e4c8604.poster.avif?t=1789576142\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/5f4014ccb08b8f1f955c6d667e4c8604.webm?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/5f4014ccb08b8f1f955c6d667e4c8604.mp4?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Professional Ship Simulator delivers deep hydrodynamic realism, including propeller torque, bank effect, wind and current drift, anchor behavior, and line tension. Operate fully simulated onboard systems, from power generation and transmission to navigation tools like Radar (with AIS\/CPA), sonar, and radio communication. Ships react physically to their environment, featuring hull damage, flooding, and simulated interaction with mooring and towing systems, including wing control stations on larger vessels.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/cde89867487b79cff0aa5408c5247924.poster.avif?t=1789576142\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/cde89867487b79cff0aa5408c5247924.webm?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/cde89867487b79cff0aa5408c5247924.mp4?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate under constantly changing conditions with a full day\/night cycle and optional real-time weather data. Dynamic systems simulate moving storm fronts, wind, currents, and sea states including fog, rain, snow, and rough seas which directly affect navigation and ship handling. The sea remains alive with AI traffic, from open-water shipping lanes to dense harbor operations, creating constantly evolving navigation challenges. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every swell, crest, and crash is modeled using realistic physics, creating a living sea that constantly challenges your ship handling skills. From gentle rolling tides to powerful storms, the water behaves dynamically, affecting speed, stability, and navigation in a way that feels true to life. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/838835755f1bfef480516ca7a0ec776e.poster.avif?t=1789576142\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/838835755f1bfef480516ca7a0ec776e.webm?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/838835755f1bfef480516ca7a0ec776e.mp4?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a growing fleet ranging from small service vessels to large commercial ships. Start with guided tutorials or take on structured missions to earn credits, expand your fleet, and acquire licenses as you progress from a small harbor operator to a professional captain. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available Ships:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tugboat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing trawler<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue vessel<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offshore ship <\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yacht<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Container ship<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bulk carrier<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LNG tanker<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise ship<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/0b72eb5d32876dfe01675437789f6f9d.poster.avif?t=1789576142\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/0b72eb5d32876dfe01675437789f6f9d.webm?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/0b72eb5d32876dfe01675437789f6f9d.mp4?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore large-scale environments based on real-world geographic data, including the Island of Rügen (60km x 120km) and the Strait of Dover (140km x 140km).<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic seamarks, navigation lights, and over 40 harbors create a believable maritime infrastructure, supported by dynamic harbor activity, wildlife, and dense coastal detail. A tile-based, moddable map system ensures long-term expandability.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/ff959dcb9b4dcbf397c0f7931c107e7c.poster.avif?t=1789576142\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/ff959dcb9b4dcbf397c0f7931c107e7c.webm?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/ff959dcb9b4dcbf397c0f7931c107e7c.mp4?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>Engage in a wide range of professional activities, including cargo transport, ferry operations, fishing with sonar, and offshore logistics. Perform specialized tasks like tug assistance, buoy maintenance, rescue missions, and firefighting. Each mission type is built on realistic systems and requires precise ship handling under real conditions, whether in structured game modes or during free exploration in the open world.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br><strong>Modding Support (Coming Soon)<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding will not be available upon launch into Early Access, but is strictly planned to be integrated very soon! <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance the game even further with custom ships, missions, and scenery extensions, as well as sound replacements and flags, allowing for a community-driven expansion of the maritime experience, all via Unreal Engine integration.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/3b95ed26b35be2e0517498c316353198.poster.avif?t=1789576142\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/3b95ed26b35be2e0517498c316353198.webm?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/3b95ed26b35be2e0517498c316353198.mp4?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/64a3da97120e7cdb00f56190c6918533.poster.avif?t=1789576142\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3636930\/extras\/64a3da97120e7cdb00f56190c6918533.webm?t=1789576142\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\